@startuml setup-token
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName "PT Sans"
skinparam shadowing false
title Claude setup-token through executor: CIP-0010 Draft (proposed)
actor "Operator" as human
participant "Enrollment" as enroll
database "Protected per-user store\nunder authentication node" as store
participant "Plan / fragment" as plan
participant "Final executor" as exec
participant "Claude process" as claude
human -> enroll : Enroll once via protected channel
enroll -> store : Save credential
store --> enroll : Opaque source_ref
enroll -> plan : Reference only
plan -> exec : source_ref (no token bytes)
exec -> store : Resolve authorized source_ref
store --> exec : Credential via protected delivery
exec -> claude : CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN at launch
note over exec,claude
No per-home login or Keychain dependency.
Inference only; Remote Control refuses.
D11 accepts this limit for swarm v0.
end note
@enduml
